## Migration Checklist

### Pre-Migration Tasks

- [ ] Backup all secrets to secure location (encrypted)
- [ ] Refresh Google OAuth token locally
- [ ] Verify all API keys are active and working
- [ ] Test database connection strings
- [ ] Rotate any keys older than 90 days
- [ ] Document all backup locations

### AWS Secrets Manager Setup

Create secrets in AWS:

```bash
# Google Service Account
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/google-creds \
  --secret-string file://secrets/google-creds.json \
  --region us-east-1

# OAuth Client
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/oauth-client \
  --secret-string file://secrets/oauth_slides_client.json \
  --region us-east-1

# OAuth Token
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/oauth-token \
  --secret-string file://secrets/token.json \
  --region us-east-1

# OpenAI API Key
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/openai-api-key \
  --secret-string "$OPENAI_API_KEY" \
  --region us-east-1

# ElevenLabs API Key
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/elevenlabs-api-key \
  --secret-string "$ELEVENLABS_API_KEY" \
  --region us-east-1

# Database URL
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name presgen/prod/database-url \
  --secret-string "postgresql://presgen:PASSWORD@postgres:5432/presgen_assess" \
  --region us-east-1
```

**Verify creation:**
```bash
aws secretsmanager list-secrets --region us-east-1 | grep presgen
```

### Transfer to Lightsail

```bash
# Create secrets directory on server
ssh -i lightsail-key.pem ubuntu@<STATIC_IP> "mkdir -p /home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets && chmod 700 /home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets"

# Transfer secrets
scp -i lightsail-key.pem secrets/google-creds.json ubuntu@<STATIC_IP>:/home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets/
scp -i lightsail-key.pem secrets/token.json ubuntu@<STATIC_IP>:/home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets/
scp -i lightsail-key.pem secrets/oauth_slides_client.json ubuntu@<STATIC_IP>:/home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets/

# Set permissions
ssh -i lightsail-key.pem ubuntu@<STATIC_IP> "chmod 600 /home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets/*"

# Verify
ssh -i lightsail-key.pem ubuntu@<STATIC_IP> "ls -la /home/ubuntu/presgen/secrets/"
```

