## Security Best Practices

### Secrets Rotation Schedule

| Secret Type | Rotation Frequency | Next Rotation | Automated? |
|-------------|-------------------|---------------|------------|
| Service Account Key | 90 days | `______` | No |
| OAuth Token | 180 days (or on expiry) | `______` | No |
| OpenAI API Key | 90 days | `______` | No |
| ElevenLabs API Key | 90 days | `______` | No |
| Database Password | 90 days | `______` | No |
| HTTP Basic Auth | Annual | `______` | No |
